    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Where Best Hydrate may fit</p>
    <h2>An optional hydration mix, not a requirement for ordinary life</h2>
    <p>Best Hydrate adds glucose and listed electrolyte sources to water. It may fit a daily routine when someone prefers a lightly flavoured hydration drink, has a physically demanding day, expects prolonged sweating or simply wants a measured alternative to other sweetened beverages.</p>
    <p>For ordinary sedentary or lightly active days, water and regular meals remain the foundation. The goal is not to convince every visitor that they need supplemental electrolytes at all times.</p>
